6. Savings status: Indicates liquid assets to manage financial risks or repayments (e.g., categories like >=1000 or no known savings).
7. Credit history: Past repayment behavior (e.g., all paid, critical/other existing credit).
8. Installment commitment: Reflects how much of their income goes toward repayments.

